Very simple at the moment. Needs serious work on the rotational stuff.

Requires a mysql copy of the Static Data Export from Eve Online, along with PHP with PDO embedded in it. Also requires three.core.min.js and three.module.min.js from the "three" npm package's build/ directory (https://www.npmjs.com/package/three), in the same directory - the renderer loads three.module.min.js as an ES module (viewer.js/systemViewer.js need to be included with <script type="module">).

Check out the code, rename db.inc.php.example to db.inc.php, edit the connection details, edit the url variable to point at your own version, then open the page in a browser. click on the grey planets to go to a new constellation.


